      "hizbQuarter": 112,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2016,
      "text": "He has only forbidden to you carrion, blood[73], flesh of swine, and what is slaughtered to other than Allah. But if one is compelled by necessity – neither driven by desire nor exceeding the need – then Allah is All-Forgiving, Most Merciful.",
